/a2run
/go.work
/go.work.sum
*.o
*.bin
*.lbl
/runs/
# internal/asmbuild's cross-process build lock (see withBuildLock).
.asmbuild.lock
*.dsk
*.img

# The hand-drawn DazzleDraw board art is a SOURCE asset, not a build
# product. The blanket *.bin rule above hid it from git entirely: it
# lived only in one working tree, was never committed, and the UI design
# was written without it (which is how the shipped board ended up as FEN
# letters). Keep it tracked.
!assets/*.bin
